    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis charming dormer-style residence, set on approximately 1.1 acres, offers a rare opportunity to acquire a property in a peaceful rural setting with outstanding scenic mountain views. While the property requires refurbishment and modernisation, it presents excellent potential for those seeking a family home, countryside retreat, or investment opportunity.\n\nIdeally located on the outskirts of Garryspillane and Kilfinane, the residence enjoys a private and secluded setting while remaining conveniently accessible to local amenities.\n\nThis property offers tremendous scope to create a beautiful countryside home in a tranquil setting, surrounded by natural beauty and enjoying generous outdoor space.\n\nAccommodation\nGround Floor, Entrance Hall, Living Room, Sitting Room, Bedroom 1, Kitchenette, DS W.C.\n\nFirst Floor: Landing, Bedroom 2,Bedroom 3\n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the potential and attractive location of this property.\n\nDormer residence requiring refurbishment\nApprox. 1.1-acre site - with Detached garage\nScenic mountain views\nPrivate and secluded location\nVehicular parking to the rear"
      },
